48:      <header class="hero">
49:        <span class="hero__chapter">Tactic #1 · Stop Coding</span>
50:        <h1>Hello Agentic Coding</h1>
51:        <p class="hero__dek">The decisive move is not a better code-generation prompt. It is turning a prompt into a reliable engineering workflow—and turning the agent into a component you can call.</p>
52:        <ul class="hero__meta" aria-label="Chapter details">
58:        <p class="hero__promise"><strong>Mastery promise.</strong> By the end, you will be able to diagnose agentic work with the Core Four, explain the exact difference between AI coding and agentic coding, reproduce Dan’s interactive and headless demos, and teach why “replace yourself” is a leverage strategy rather than a surrender.</p>
59:        <figure class="frame-card generated-plate generated-plate--hero">
