180:          <h3>The repository describes a worker, not a product</h3>
182:          <div class="file-map">
183:            <div class="file-map__item"><code>README.md</code><p>Holds the phase-one and phase-two prompts plus the three launcher commands.</p></div>
184:            <div class="file-map__item"><code>.claude/settings.json</code><p>Declares the tools the agent may use: three file tools, UV, four Git operations, and WebSearch.</p></div>
185:            <div class="file-map__item"><code>programmable/prompt.md</code><p>Packages a self-contained branch → create → run → commit → report workflow.</p></div>
186:            <div class="file-map__item"><code>programmable/*.{sh,py,ts}</code><p>Calls the same prompt from three host languages, proving the agent is a component.</p></div>
187:            <div class="file-map__item"><code>.env.sample</code><p>Contains the API-key placeholder used by the headless billing path.</p></div>
188:            <div class="file-map__item"><code>main_*.py</code><p><strong>Not source files at the start.</strong> They are runtime artifacts created by the agent.</p></div>
