224:          <h3>Close the section before revealing answers</h3>
225:          <section class="retrieval-quiz" aria-label="Retrieval questions for the Agentic Engineer role">
226:            <div class="retrieval-quiz__item"><p class="retrieval-quiz__q">1. What behavior, not job title, defines Dan’s Agentic Engineer?</p><details class="retrieval-quiz__a"><summary>Reveal answer</summary><p>Building systems that can take actions as engineers can—such as branching, writing, running, committing, and reporting.</p></details></div>
227:            <div class="retrieval-quiz__item"><p class="retrieval-quiz__q">2. Why is an excellent one-shot code prompt still phase-one shaped?</p><details class="retrieval-quiz__a"><summary>Reveal answer</summary><p>Because the output is code while the human still carries the engineering workflow around it. Quality does not change who performs the transitions.</p></details></div>
228:            <div class="retrieval-quiz__item"><p class="retrieval-quiz__q">3. What is the smallest observable proof that your role has moved?</p><details class="retrieval-quiz__a"><summary>Reveal answer</summary><p>A system completes at least one meaningful multi-action chain without the human relaying intermediate results, then returns evidence for review.</p></details></div>
232:        <div class="move move--teach">
233:          <p class="move-label">10 · Teach-back prompt</p>
234:          <div class="teach-back">
236:            <p class="fine">Pass if your explanation includes actions, a repeatable system, and a report—not merely “AI does more.”</p>
241:      <section class="chapter-section idea-cycle" id="idea-mission">
242:        <span class="section-number">02</span>
243:        <h2 class="section-title">The mission: command compute through leverage</h2>
244:        <p class="section-lead">The tactic is emotionally difficult because it asks you to retire a visible skill. The mission supplies the reason: move up the stack from producing keystrokes to designing systems that produce outcomes.</p>
246:        <div class="move move--hook">
247:          <p class="move-label">1 · Hook — concrete failure</p>
248:          <h3>The faster typist who cannot escape throughput</h3>
