         <div class="lesson"><span class="lesson__n">16</span><div><strong><a href="vol-3-ma/16-lead-agents.html">Multi-Team Agentic Coding / Lead Agents</a></strong><p>MA-2 · Domain-locked depth-2 teams · Chapter complete</p></div><span class="badge badge--done">Done</span></div>
         <div class="lesson"><span class="lesson__n">17</span><div><strong><a href="vol-3-ma/17-ui-agents.html">Infinite UI Agents</a></strong><p>Tactic: Own the Harness · Chapter complete</p></div><span class="badge badge--done">Done</span></div>
-        <div class="lesson"><span class="lesson__n">18</span><div><strong>The Pi Verifier Agent</strong><p>Chapter pending</p></div><span class="badge badge--pending">Pending</span></div>
+        <div class="lesson"><span class="lesson__n">18</span><div><strong><a href="vol-3-ma/18-verifier-agent.html">The Pi Verifier Agent</a></strong><p>Tactic: Spend Tokens to Save Time · Chapter complete</p></div><span class="badge badge--done">Done</span></div>
       </div>
