+        <aside class="current-practice">
+          <p class="current-practice__label">Publication note</p>
+          <p>Both IDs and titles come from the locked lesson extract. Direct metadata resolution was unavailable in this build environment, so re-check the links at publication. The teased agentic-security video has no approved ID and is intentionally omitted.</p>
